oard by, cut through.\n4. Profile (outside): cuts the board out with rounded corners, leaving 4 small holding tabs.\n\nBefore cutting for real\n- Use a hardwood that is safe for food (maple, beech, walnut) and a food-safe oil to finish; sand all the edges and the groove.\n- Set X0 Y0 at the lower-left corner and Z0 on the top of the stock, and tick \"Air cut\" in each operation for a first run.","act":4,"oid":4}}